    <briefdescription>
<para>Represents the growth characteristics and current biomasses of an edible object. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class models the growth state of an edible entity (resource or animal) by storing:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Its current instar (developmental stage).</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>The associated species growth model.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Its current total dry and wet mass.</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>It provides utilities to update the instar, set masses, and compute wet mass from dry mass according to the species-specific growth rules. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
